  "Software Details": "Yazılım Detayları",
  "Effortlessly manage your restaurant's menu with Dash SaaS. Our intuitive interface allows you to create, edit, and organize menu items with ease. Whether you're updating prices, and descriptions, or adding new dishes, everything can be done in just a few clicks. Say goodbye to difficult menu management processes and hello to an effortless experience that saves you time and effort.": "Dash SaaS ile restoranınızın menüsünü zahmetsizce yönetin. ",
  "/Month": "/Ay",
  "/Year": "/Yıl",
  "Buy Now": "Şimdi al",
  "View Live Demo": "Canlı Demoyu Görüntüle",
  "Dynamic Offers and Promotions": "Dinamik Teklifler ve Promosyonlar",
  "Boost your sales and attract more customers with our offers management feature. With Dash SaaS, creating and managing special promotions has never been easier. From happy hour deals to seasonal discounts, you can set up and customize offers to suit your restaurant`s needs. Watch as your promotions drive traffic and increase revenue, all from within the convenience of our platform.": "Teklif yönetimi özelliğimizle satışlarınızı artırın ve daha fazla müşteri çekin. ",
  "Efficient Table Arrangements": "Verimli Masa Düzenlemeleri",
  "Optimize your dining space and streamline your operations with our table arrangement feature. Easily set up and modify table layouts, assign reservations, and keep track of available seating. With Dash SaaS, managing your restaurant`s floor plan has never been easier, allowing you to maximize efficiency and provide a seamless dining experience for your guests.": "Masa düzenleme özelliğimizle yemek alanınızı optimize edin ve operasyonlarınızı kolaylaştırın. ",
  "Customization and Real-time Updates": "Özelleştirme ve Gerçek Zamanlı Güncellemeler",
  "Tailor your menu to fit your restaurant`s unique identity with our attribute and category creation tools. Whether you`re creating tags like \"spicy\" or \"vegetarian\" or organizing items into categories like \"appetizers\" and \"desserts,\" you have complete control over how your menu is presented. Plus, with instant front-end updates, any changes you make are immediately visible to your customers, ensuring that they always have access to the most current information.": "Özellik ve kategori oluşturma araçlarımızla menünüzü restoranınızın benzersiz kimliğine uyacak şekilde uyarlayın. ",
  "Enhanced Customer Engagement": "Gelişmiş Müşteri Etkileşimi",
  "Take your customer service to the next level with our customer management tools. Add new customers to your database and store valuable information such as contact details and dining preferences. With this data at your fingertips, you can provide personalized recommendations and tailored experiences that keep your customers coming back for more.": "Müşteri yönetimi araçlarımızla müşteri hizmetlerinizi bir sonraki seviyeye taşıyın. ",
  "Real-time Frontend Updates": "Gerçek Zamanlı Ön Uç Güncellemeleri",
  "With Dash SaaS, any changes you make to your menu, offers, or dining table arrangements are instantly visible on the front end. Whether you`re updating prices, creating new offers, or adjusting dining table layouts, your customers will always have access to the most up-to-date information. Say goodbye to manual updates and hello to a seamlessly integrated experience for both you and your customers.": "Dash SaaS ile menünüzde, tekliflerinizde veya yemek masası düzenlemelerinizde yaptığınız her türlü değişiklik ön uçta anında görünür. ",
